Source: ladybird-unstable
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://ladybird.org

Package: ladybird-unstable
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libcairo2, libcups2t64, libdbus-1-3, libdrm2, libexpat1, libglib2.0-0t64, libicu78, libncurses6, libpulse0, libqt6core6t64, libqt6gui6, libqt6positioning6, libqt6widgets6, libtinfo6, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb1
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers, qt6-wayland
Description: Truly independent web browser (git master; unstable)
 Ladybird is a truly independent web browser built from the upstream git master
 branch. This package is unstable by construction: it tracks upstream main.
